  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 310.08 Post-Issuance Requirements for SMMD Permits",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 310.08 Post-Issuance Requirements for SMMD Permits.\n\n(a) Subject to (b), below, any individual operating under an SMMD permit shall post the permit in the immediate vicinity of the dredging operation where it can be seen by anyone approaching the activity.\n\n(b) If it is not practical to post the permit, the permittee shall have the original permit or a clear copy thereof available for inspection by anyone who requests to see it.\n\nSource. #12803, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt300.html"
}
